{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015It seems that in this world, immortal humans are called \u2018Players\u2019. A world where immortality became commonplace after a great war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When people reach adulthood, they are granted the right to become a Player. Upon turning 20, the protagonist Eve, urged by her anxious mother, headed to the hospital to become a Player as soon as possible. In a world where no one dies anymore, what will she think, and what will she choose? One day, she suddenly senses something amiss about this world. Become her, gather information through conversations and exploration, and unravel that sense of unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015Because it's something only you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Imitation\u2019 is an adventure game set in a world where immortality is commonplace. Playtime: 3~4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Controls: Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, questions will arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information to solve these mysteries. Solving one puzzle will spark the next question. Repeating this cycle, you will eventually uncover the truth hidden within this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Gather Information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Choices During Conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000The information you obtain varies based on the choices you make during conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/9468bf19a738844fb6d6a61c6a9ba60d.avif?t=1758529101\" width=1520 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Hover your cursor over areas that catch your interest and click to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/6bb05a08c8777ef4c890d3a3ad11eb11.poster.avif?t=1758529101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/6bb05a08c8777ef4c890d3a3ad11eb11.webm?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/6bb05a08c8777ef4c890d3a3ad11eb11.mp4?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Reflect on Memorable Logs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Conversations that leave an impression on the protagonist will be added to a list. Choose what you need and forget what you don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/8dadf44e8918221c877d99abf9c08e53.poster.avif?t=1758529101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/8dadf44e8918221c877d99abf9c08e53.webm?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/8dadf44e8918221c877d99abf9c08e53.mp4?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, your actions and choices affect your Stress and Affinity levels. These values can restrict your actions, so choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/0584f053cffee5d7f2e37677ac9dfb7e.poster.avif?t=1758529101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/0584f053cffee5d7f2e37677ac9dfb7e.webm?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/extras/0584f053cffee5d7f2e37677ac9dfb7e.mp4?t=1758529101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927570?t=1758529101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927570?t=1758529101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/34e96a6a6216a33a2622000cfd6f22c6671d6942/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758529101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927570/34e96a6a6216a33a2622000cfd6f22c6671d6942/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758529101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015It seems that in this world, immortal humans are called \u2018Players\u2019. A world where immortality became commonplace after a great war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When people reach adulthood, they are granted the right to become a Player. Upon turning 20, the protagonist Eve, urged by her anxious mother, headed to the hospital to become a Player as soon as possible. In a world where no one dies anymore, what will she think, and what will she choose? One day, she suddenly senses something amiss about this world. Become her, gather information through conversations and exploration, and unravel that sense of uneas